skRunner pid=2945368)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m [36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m Combining the real and imaginary parts, we get:[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m [36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m \[[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + i(4(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta) + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m [36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m Simplifying further, we get:[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m [36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m \[[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + i(300\sin\theta + 468\cos\theta + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta) = 324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + i(300\sin\theta + 504\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m [36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m The real part of this expression is:[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m [36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m \[[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m 324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m [36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m To maximize this real part, we need to find the maximum value of the expression \(324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta\). This can be done by expressing it in the form \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\), where \(R = \sqrt{324^2 + 468^2}\).[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m [36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m \[[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m R = \sqrt{324^2 + 468^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 219024} = \sqrt{324000} = 360\sqrt{3}[36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m [36m(TaskRunner pid=2945368)[0m The maximum value of \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\) is \(R\), so the maximum value of \(324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta\) is \(360\sqrt{3}\).[36